# Single source of truth for "which shell scripts this repository lints".
#
# Consumers:
#   - tests/unit/shellcheck-scope_test.bats, which fails if a build script
#     matches none of the patterns below.
#   - Informational mirror of `just lint`, which currently walks the whole
#     tree with `find . -iname "*.sh"`. The recipe is intentionally left as-is
#     so this manifest does not change the local lint scope; see the Task 3
#     report for why it is not wired into the recipe.
#
# One bash glob per line. Patterns are expanded from the repository root with
# `shopt -s globstar nullglob`, so `**` crosses directories. Blank lines and
# lines beginning with `#` are ignored. Do not add trailing whitespace or
# inline comments: the contract test rejects whitespace outside comment lines.
build/**/*.sh
ci/**/*.sh
custom/**/*.sh
